# elm-wallet-main and main

- Daily work stays on `elm-wallet-main`. Push to remote `et-wallet`, not `origin`, unless James asks.
- This checkout is the **newer client**. `et-wallet/main` is the same app with a **different client**. Never replace one UI with the other.
- Do not `git checkout main` in this directory. Port through sibling worktree `../elm-safe-adapt-main` on branch `adapt/elm-wallet-main`.
- **After every commit or push on `elm-wallet-main`**, immediately reimplement the same behavior on `adapt/elm-wallet-main` (from `et-wallet/main`), run the relevant tests, push to `et-wallet`, and open or update a PR into `main`. Do not merge that PR unless James asks.
- Reimplement against main's files. Do not copy `src/` wholesale. Server/auth ports are usually small; client ports must keep main's layout and copy.
- Full reminder: `docs/dual-client.md`
